  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 - Added .NET 10 (Preview) multi-targeting support. All projects now target net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0. Requires base package [2.1.0]. All 81 crawler tests passing on all three frameworks (243 test runs, 0 failures). Zero breaking changes.\n\t\t\t2.0.0 - Initial release of crawler extension package. All web crawling features moved from base package. Requires exact version match with base package [2.0.0]. 54 tests passing. Features: SiteCrawler, SimpleSiteCrawler, robots.txt parsing, HTML extraction, SignalR progress, CSV export.",
